<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to transfer the assets, rights and
liabilities of the Benevolent Society of New South Wales constituted under the
<legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Benevolent Society of New South Wales Act
1902</i></name></legref> to a company of that name and limited by guarantee;
to repeal that Act; and for related purposes.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0b629230-fc51-4f9a-94c9-3abe93dcb0f9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_1835a02f-6cbe-40b0-a501-313f31a81f53"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown" refid="act-1998-153"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Benevolent
Society (Reconstitution) Act 1998</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_be469910-2d2a-496f-af31-331f7dd95957"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_b9058d4c-946e-4190-abf8-224531fe64aa"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day or days to be
appointed by proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bc78d989-ccfa-402a-908b-81e9bc37882e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_236049b0-ae95-4863-9ad1-24739d865152"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c66d347b-8b82-4435-8928-a4565787411c"
id="def.assets"><b><i>assets</i></b></defterm> means any legal or equitable
estate or interest (whether present or future and whether vested or
contingent) in real or personal property of any description (including money),
and includes securities, choses in action, and documents.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_60731e56-43c2-4603-9e0b-a1a9e4e1041c"
id="def.bylaws"><b><i>by-laws</i></b></defterm> includes rules or
regulations.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_dc9eb107-3146-43e5-97f0-d95e7f087fe7"
id="def.Company"><b><i>Company</i></b></defterm> means the Benevolent Society
of New South Wales, a company limited by guarantee (ACN 084 695 045), and, if
the name of the company is duly changed, includes the company under its then
current name.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_21f6b1b6-4866-45f0-b9d5-3d2e2ceb28d0" id="def.formerbody"><b><i>former
body</i></b></defterm> means the Benevolent Society of New South Wales
constituted as a body corporate by the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Benevolent Society of New South Wales
Act 1902</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_e1a5dc15-40c1-44ec-ad6f-9ae787e8f2c4"
id="def.liabilities"><b><i>liabilities</i></b></defterm> means any
liabilities, debts or obligations (whether present or future and whether
vested or contingent).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_7fa4bdc6-fc96-4377-bd9c-193aabef89a8"
id="def.rights"><b><i>rights</i></b></defterm> means any rights, powers,
privileges or immunities (whether present or future and whether vested or
contingent).</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_202069ef-8b14-42da-a6ea-00d456e7aa0e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_d8bf9b1d-538e-4fbf-aeff-0cb89c551d00"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Dissolution of former body</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_25c39612-269e-4269-94c3-23534dc36d44"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The former body is dissolved:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_67327b82-0ece-419a-91ec-8bd5bd8984c5" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">on the commencement of this section,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_85c71661-b79b-41fc-8914-3f9ee5c90be9" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">immediately after the conclusion of a general
meeting of members of the former body at which final accounts of the former
body are approved and the former body is declared to be
dissolved,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">whichever is the later.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1bbe88f1-c73e-4198-bcf6-d2b98ab28b65"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">On dissolution of the former body:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d8700bfe-67bc-4004-ba08-9625d4bbdcce" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Company is taken to be a continuation of, and
the same legal entity as, the former body, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5872969e-2bdc-49d7-b295-352f5c5423eb" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a reference in any Act, in any instrument made
under any Act, or in any document of any kind, to the former body is taken to
include a reference to the Company, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_954d2443-664f-412d-8617-f1ab432187e7" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the board of directors of the former body is
dissolved, and the directors and office holders of the former body cease to
hold their respective offices as such.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bc7ab5b5-55a8-4151-a79d-faa4002feff5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_470d7420-583a-48da-9e50-bcf832b883eb"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Transfer of assets, rights and
liabilities</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dc139d20-8e90-4390-895c-bc4fb81ad3dc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The assets, rights and liabilities of the former
body are transferred to the Company by force of this
section.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_25633194-9b8e-4929-bd5f-e320ab2cf300"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (1), the staff of the
former body are transferred to the Company by force of this
section.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0306ebec-f72a-4d72-8c6a-8db55950def0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">It is not lawful for the Company to alienate,
mortgage, charge or demise any land acquired by the former body by grant from
the Crown, except:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b7841118-9888-4234-ac50-be2009a1648f" id="sec.5-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">with the approval of the Governor,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_10a02d87-25e4-4917-a4fc-4766c03b4478" id="sec.5-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">by way of a complying
lease.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dd53c707-6175-4b7b-a22a-b4bb151a555d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of this section, a complying
lease is a lease for any term not exceeding 21 years from the time of granting
any such lease, and in and by which there is reserved and made payable during
the whole of the term of the lease the best yearly rent that can reasonably be
obtained without any fine or premium.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5901dc09-2f44-40a7-8b5c-e682bf9bd905"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_4f40b788-b37b-4300-bc40-96a95a13d78f"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Stamp duty</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ac0cf2ec-9041-4b52-903d-048d35a65a4a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without affecting the generality of section 275
of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"
refid="act-1997-123"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Duties Act
1997</i></name></legref>, duty under that Act is not chargeable on a transfer
by or pursuant to this Act, or anything certified by the Minister as having
been done in consequence of a transfer by or pursuant to this Act (for
example, the transfer or conveyance of an interest in
land).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_96c18971-4a43-4fee-a0be-d731c4c1f03a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may, by notice in writing, confirm a
transfer of particular assets, rights or liabilities by operation of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3b439564-d0c5-45ce-a459-24a428c97bc7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Such a notice is conclusive evidence of that
transfer.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_eb3003b8-983e-4681-9923-2eb0590938cb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_b5e14e7e-5ab1-43de-8bf8-4cf7526d264b"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Repeals</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6edc0ef9-0a30-49a1-a5d8-3d046991dc49"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Benevolent Society of New South Wales
Act 1902</i></name> (1902 No 97)</legref> is repealed.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2cb8d287-1442-4bc6-947c-2ea13745bf6e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">All by-laws made under the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Benevolent Society of New
South Wales Act 1902</i></name></legref> are repealed.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6650ef5f-f560-41db-8281-9ae07f62c26c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A copy of any by-laws of the former body,
purporting to be certified by an officer of the Company as being correct, is
to be received in any court or tribunal as conclusive of
them.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</content>


